Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20LVGL=20=E5=AF=B9=E9=BD=90=E5=8E=9F?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=8E=82=20G2D=20=E6=97=8B=E8=BD=AC=E7=BF=BB=E9=A1=B5=EF=BC=88?=
 =?UTF-8?q?DIRECT=5FMODE=20+=20FBIOPAN=EF=BC=89?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

仅合入 sunxifb/G2D 旋转与翻页：去掉 split_fb/dmabuf 混用，blit 走 smem_start，开 G2D/DIRECT_MODE。
不含 ZS101、投屏、点歌等其它改动。CACHE 保持关闭。

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
